
@startuml
title 酒店预订系统——顺序图1：顾客预订房间

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ParticipantBorderColor #1F2D3D
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0000CC
    ParticipantFontSize 16
    LifeLineBorderColor #1F2D3D
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    MessageFontColor #0000CC
    MessageFontSize 13
}
<style>
participant {
    Padding 28
}
</style>
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

hide footbox

actor "顾客" as Customer
participant ":顾客界面" as UI
participant ":酒店查询" as Search
participant ":库存与价格管理" as Stock
participant ":预订订单管理" as Booking
participant ":预订订单" as Order
participant ":操作日志" as Log

Customer -> UI : 输入城市、入住日期、离店日期及人数
UI -> Search : 查询酒店和可用房型
Search -> Stock : 查询每日库存和价格
Stock --> Search : 返回房型可用情况及价格
Search --> UI : 返回酒店和房型列表

Customer -> UI : 选择房型并提交预订
UI -> Booking : 提交预订信息
Booking -> Stock : 校验并占用所选日期库存
Stock --> Booking : 返回库存校验及占用结果

Booking -> Order : 创建预订订单并保存成交价格
Order --> Booking : 返回订单号及初始状态

Booking -> Log : 记录订单创建和库存操作
Log --> Booking : 返回记录成功

Booking --> UI : 返回订单号及订单状态
UI --> Customer : 显示预订结果

@enduml
